    This  archive  contains  LaTeX-files  of  V.Edneral's   paper 
"Normal  Form  Method and Seminumerical  Solutions  of  Nonlinear 
ODEs".  This paper has been submitted to the Journal of  Symbolic 
Computation.

Keywords:  Systems of nonlinear ordinary differential  equations, 
periodic  solutions,  Fourier  / power  series  approximation  of 
periodic solutions.

    Content:

1. fig1.tex
2. fig2.tex
3. he10fig.tex
4. jsc.sty
5. paper.tex
6. readme
7. vdp28fig.tex

    The paper.tex is the main LaTeX file.  Really it needs to  be 
processed by BigTeX.  If your TeX reports to you that it has  not 
enough  room  you should comment  all lines  with  an  "\include" 
instruction  (2 lines) in the paper.tex file,  treat it as  usual 
LaTeX  file  and  produce  2 pictures  from  files  fig1.tex  and 
fig2.tex by LaTeX separately from the paper itself. Unfortunately
a  usage of the Journal of Symbolic Computation style (jsc.sty  - 
file) gives an error message at "\bibitem" instructions for  some 
TeX/LaTeX  versions.  If in this situation you press  "q"  letter 
after the error message (i.e.  invoke TeX "batch mode") and close 
your eyes you probably will have a proper result.

    Sincerely yours,
    Victor  Edneral

